<description>&lt;p&gt;Federal forces are advancing in Tigray while militia attacks near the Ethiopia-Kenya border have killed civilians and displaced thousands, raising the refugee count in Kenya above 50,000. Eritrean forces have carried out drone and artillery strikes near Badme and Ethiopian drones are operating over Sudan, with RSF drones launching from Ethiopian territory against Sudanese targets, prompting diplomatic expulsions and consular closures. Heavy weapon clashes have spread on the Oromia-Somali border to Mieso and Afdem, and fighting in Moyale deepens a territorial dispute. The conflict caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/fresh-clashes-at-the-eritrean-border-is-ethiopia-sliding-into-a-regional-war/a-79970353?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxNeEJBNVB0dkdmX1h1VU1fRTJkVGdQN3oyWWZlOTBqaFVPOHBIcWk2YlJ1M2poeFpLcWxlNV9rOHBQYTRwdzRaN2ZKbkNveGgyMkFBRmY1b2t4REJSampnVjdaZnlmYVA3Vm1oU0o5T093T0t0QjNQZU8xeHRzWGZRaERvVXJpUFNqZDhQcjZfSVFHSktmVGZ5anIzZWpxMXlfU0VqR2VybTFlSzl1R0M1R01IY1BEanRJSFJQQU5pLWFXMGs?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE8zNTVaTFVVNVY0SUFBX1BrS05MM0kzUzluajhFZTcwdC02ekRERU5VbkZDajRNMUw3VmRSQVAyR1RoM1dNamNEVTJLR2Q5SXY2Q29aUEpDVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE5VUzBzZDdGOTFaZDRVZUdGRVpobjd6UUxsTnZOWFRuZVVCSEtvcUIxdnR6SU9xb3JQYlVFR3dmbDVuYVoyVld3VG1aYmpfZU5SSUN0dzgzQV8?oc=5&quot;&gt;AFP Fact Check&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNWkQzZEItMXVKUlRxQWxvWWJlQVpGTmk4UXVwbVZWeW54MWVYaUcwUXpUUlN4QTJHMEI1